  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards Culture of Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 4 tier project that will be conducted in 12 governorates of Jordan. 45 interactive theatre performances in public schools, CBOs &amp; 1 performance dedicated to MPs to combat violence &amp; promote values of tolerance &amp; understanding with students in public schools; Develop &amp; publish Teacher&#x2019;s Activity Guide book to conduct activities with students in the class room; Training of 100 Ministry of Education teachers in Drama In Education (DIE) and facilitation techniques in Amman, Zarqa, Irbid and Karak.</narrative>
  </description>
